+# context-teardown — delta
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+### Requirement: Complete teardown after failures
+Flask SHALL attempt every registered teardown callback and the corresponding
+teardown signal during request and application-context teardown, even when an
+earlier teardown callback raises.
+
+#### Scenario: Multiple request teardown failures
+- WHEN more than one request teardown callback raises
+- THEN later callbacks and the request teardown signal run, and Flask reports
+  all collected teardown failures after cleanup finishes.
+
+#### Scenario: Application context restoration
+- WHEN teardown callbacks raise while an application or request context is popped
+- THEN the context-local application state is restored before the failure is
+  raised to the caller.
+
+## MODIFIED Requirements
+
+## REMOVED Requirements
